shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":"WJ10128","city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":3,"stats":[76,60,61,62,70,86],"title":-1,"rank":"5","loyalty":"95","reputation":"1850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1020805","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1073","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,60,61,62,70,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1020805","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1044","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,60,61,62,70,86],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1020805","shield":"WP1009502"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"蜀国武将，永昌太守。孟获于高定等人南方造乱时被其围城，但其坚守下成功坚持到诸葛亮带领援军到来，使得孟获等人退守。诸葛亮南征平定叛乱后，深深为王伉和吕凯的忠诚与坚守所感动，班师时，特意留下王伉与吕凯镇守南中四郡，成为蜀汉南方屏障。","tc":"蜀國武將，永昌太守。孟獲于高定等人南方造亂時被其圍城，但其堅守下成功堅持到諸葛亮帶領援軍到來，使得孟獲等人退守。諸葛亮南征平定叛亂后，深深為王伉和呂凱的忠誠與堅守所感動，班師時，特意留下王伉與呂凱鎮守南中四郡，成為蜀漢南方屏障。","en":"An officer of Shu and Governor of Yongchang. When Meng Huo and Gao Ding fomented rebellion in the south, his city was besieged, but he held firm until Zhuge Liang arrived with reinforcements, forcing Meng Huo and the others to fall back. After Zhuge Liang's southern campaign pacified the rebellion, deeply moved by the loyalty and perseverance of Wang Kang and Lu Kai, he specifically assigned them to garrison the four commanderies of Nanzhong upon his return north, making them the southern shield of Shu Han.","jp":"蜀の武将、永昌太守。孟獲や高定らが南方で乱を起こした際、城を包囲されたが、堅守により諸葛亮率いる援軍が到着するまで持ちこたえ、孟獲らを退守に追い込んだ。諸葛亮は南征によって反乱を平定した後、王伉と呂凱の忠誠と堅守に深く心を打たれ、帰還の際、特意王伉と呂凱を留めて南中四郡を守らせ、蜀漢の南の防壁とした。","kr":"촉나라의 무장이자 영창태수이다. 맹획과 고정 등이 남방에서 반란을 일으켰을 때 성을 포위당했으나, 굳게 지켜낸 끝에 제갈량이 이끄는 원군이 당도할 때까지 버텨내어 맹획 무리를 퇴각시켰다. 제갈량은 남정을 통해 반란을 평정한 후, 왕항과 여개의 충절과 굳은 의지에 깊이 감동하여 회군할 때 특별히 왕항과 여개를 남겨 남중 4군을 진수하게 하였으며, 이는 촉한의 남방을 지키는 방벽이 되었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10659","remark":"","surname":"王","surnameTc":"王","surnameEn":"Wang","surnameJp":"王","surnameKr":"왕","surnameOther":"","name":"伉","nameTc":"伉","nameEn":"Kang","nameJp":"伉","nameKr":"항","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"王伉","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"215","city":"CS1073","gender":"0","rule":"76","force":"60","wise":"61","politics":"62","charm":"70","will":"86","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"6","wiseTalent":"6","politicsTalent":"6","charmTalent":"6","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"50/50/51/50/50/50/50/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5700","battleSoulPoint":"3600","debateSoulPoint":"3700","strategy":"","strategy2":"","professions":"3/0/0/2/2/0/2/1/0/1/1/1/2/1/0/0/2/0/2/1/0/1/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"7","compatible":"47","loyalty":"0","reputation":"600","evaluate":"0","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"184","show":"215","death":"254","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"1","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"0","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1007505","helmet":"WP1020805","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"WP1009502","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;26/2;31/1;59/1;12/2","father":"","mother":"","children":"","fa